{"type":"message","id":"fe5cafd3","parentId":"5cd17ea5","timestamp":"2026-04-05T10:24:27.513Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户说\"授权\"，可能是想让我帮他进行飞书 OAuth 授权。我之前尝试过 batch_auth 但失败了，因为需要 App Owner 权限。\n\n让我再试一次普通的 OAuth 流程，或者看看有没有其他方式。\n\n实际上，根据工具描述，feishu_oauth 工具是用于撤销授权的（revoke），不是用于发起授权的。授权流程应该是系统自动发起的。\n\n让我试试看，也许用户需要重新授权？","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n我这边无法直接发起授权流程，但可以帮你检查一下当前的授权状态：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7tz2r0siqpa2_1","name":"feishu_get_user","arguments":{}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":416,"output":124,"cacheRead":41213,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41753,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775384664353}}
