{"type":"message","id":"249134e8","parentId":"7bdf9da1","timestamp":"2026-04-05T10:27:12.537Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_bezde933jy79_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5228a03a60a0c2ec059843ef013\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"media\",\n      \"content\": \"<video key=\\\"file_v3_0010f_3302351d-4381-4f57-9724-6653df43426g\\\" name=\\\"digital_human.mp4\\\" duration=\\\"0ms\\\"/>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T10:54:39+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52289da9113cc4abb3dfe5b374d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"不好意思刚才发送出了问题，我现在重新上传视频，马上就能收到~\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T10:47:18+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523d72835ca4c36a13537eae4ec\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"audio\",\n      \"content\": \"<audio key=\\\"file_v3_0010e_ef4d03fa-932b-4bbe-93ad-3bd445704beg\\\" duration=\\\"8ms\\\"/>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T12:29:57+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523d74ec4ca8c2df55b251ad9f6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210e_01fb89aa-8051-4d52-938f-37f0b8cea59g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T12:29:22+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523d7825d0a0b3b46904842afa3\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"✅ 12点复盘已完成，当前工作进展：1. 定时复盘功能已配置 2. 实时视频落地roadmap已梳理 3. 用户身份图片/语音发送工具已开发完成，正在测试中。接下来先测试原生图片发送功能~\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T12:28:30+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53aff4fcb4a0c3361277e1559e9\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"晁总您好!我已经学习了\\\"北方西北区-执政官晁留柱\\\"群的历史记录,梳理了完整情况并创建了文档。\\n\\n📋 梳理要点:\\n1. 群基本情况:39位成员,北方西北区域店总沟通群\\n2. 近期核心事件:执政官换届选举(4月24日竞选)、总经理回家日(重庆)\\n3. AI推广:您在积极推广豆包、妙搭、workbuddy等AI工具\\n4. 政策变化:百达屋企业卡4月1日起调整,不再支持固定协议价\\n\\n📄 文档链接:https://www.feishu.cn/docx/GNrcdNhO0oeLnpxAB5TcnazOnId\\n\\n我已经进群了,后续会默默关注群里的情况,您需要时随时@我。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-30T07:54:11+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53afe01e54b4b36502e8cbebbf6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"我已经梳理完北方西北区域店总沟通群的历史情况啦：\\n\\n### 群基本信息\\n- 群定位：德胧集团北方西北区域店总沟通群，由您负责管理\\n\\n### 近期核心待办事项\\n1. **总经理回家日活动**：4月24日在重庆举办，全体店总原则上需参会，交通住宿由业主承担，会议包含执政官竞选、虫洞AI系统发布、经营数据共创等核心议程\\n2. **执政官换届选举**：报名截止4月10日，4月24日现场投票，当选者将作为区域政策传达和问题反馈的枢纽\\n3. **匿名问题墙问卷**：每日推送，用于收集一线遇到的需要集团解决的问题\\n\\n### 近期工作重点\\n- 正在大力推广AI工具应用：包括ArkClaw（小龙虾）、豆包、腾讯workbuddy等，鼓励店总使用AI提升工作效率\\n- 会员营销政策落地：近期有专项解读会，解答落地执行中的疑问\\n\\n我会持续关注群内动态，有重要信息会及时同步给您~\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-30T07:51:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"page_token\": \"\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b5228a03a60a0c2ec059843ef013","msg_type":"media","content":"<video key=\"file_v3_0010f_3302351d-4381-4f57-9724-6653df43426g\" name=\"digital_human.mp4\" duration=\"0ms\"/>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-05T10:54:39+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52289da9113cc4abb3dfe5b374d","msg_type":"text","content":"不好意思刚才发送出了问题，我现在重新上传视频，马上就能收到~","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-05T10:47:18+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b523d72835ca4c36a13537eae4ec","msg_type":"audio","content":"<audio key=\"file_v3_0010e_ef4d03fa-932b-4bbe-93ad-3bd445704beg\" duration=\"8ms\"/>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T12:29:57+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b523d74ec4ca8c2df55b251ad9f6","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210e_01fb89aa-8051-4d52-938f-37f0b8cea59g)","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T12:29:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b523d7825d0a0b3b46904842afa3","msg_type":"text","content":"✅ 12点复盘已完成，当前工作进展：1. 定时复盘功能已配置 2. 实时视频落地roadmap已梳理 3. 用户身份图片/语音发送工具已开发完成，正在测试中。接下来先测试原生图片发送功能~","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T12:28:30+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53aff4fcb4a0c3361277e1559e9","msg_type":"text","content":"晁总您好!我已经学习了\"北方西北区-执政官晁留柱\"群的历史记录,梳理了完整情况并创建了文档。\n\n📋 梳理要点:\n1. 群基本情况: