{"type":"message","id":"5759ff50","parentId":"9b6acfaa","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:22:02.067Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I can make voice calls via Feishu. Let me check the available tools to see if there's a voice calling capability.\n\nLooking at the tools available:\n- There's no direct Feishu voice call tool in my toolkit\n- I have a \"voice-call\" skill mentioned in the config, but it's for general voice calls, not specifically Feishu\n\nLet me check what voice-related tools/skills I have access to.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"目前我没有飞书语音电话的直接能力。让我查一下可用的语音相关工具：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_st4cgtejvii5_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la ~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/ | grep -i voice"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":55446,"output":153,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55599,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775388113056}}
