{"type":"message","id":"3b6bed2b","parentId":"e33d43fb","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:22:04.195Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check what the voice-call skill does.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e17dac88vmee_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/voice-call/SKILL.md","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":87,"output":63,"cacheRead":55549,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55699,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775388122094}}
{"type":"message","id":"36d49430","parentId":"3b6bed2b","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:22:04.210Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_e17dac88vmee_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: voice-call\ndescription: Start voice calls via the OpenClaw voice-call plugin.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"emoji\": \"📞\",\n        \"skillKey\": \"voice-call\",\n        \"requires\": { \"config\": [\"plugins.entries.voice-call.enabled\"] },\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# Voice Call\n\nUse the voice-call plugin to start or inspect calls (Twilio, Telnyx, Plivo, or mock).\n\n## CLI\n\n```bash\nopenclaw voicecall call --to \"+15555550123\" --message \"Hello from OpenClaw\"\nopenclaw voicecall status --call-id <id>\n```\n\n## Tool\n\nUse `voice_call` for agent-initiated calls.\n\nActions:\n\n- `initiate_call` (message, to?, mode?)\n- `continue_call` (callId, message)\n- `speak_to_user` (callId, message)\n- `end_call` (callId)\n- `get_status` (callId)\n\nNotes:\n\n- Requires the voice-call plugin to be enabled.\n- Plugin config lives under `plugins.entries.voice-call.config`.\n- Twilio config: `provider: \"twilio\"` + `twilio.accountSid/authToken` + `fromNumber`.\n- Telnyx config: `provider: \"telnyx\"` + `telnyx.apiKey/connectionId` + `fromNumber`.\n- Plivo config: `provider: \"plivo\"` + `plivo.authId/authToken` + `fromNumber`.\n- Dev fallback: `provider: \"mock\"` (no network).\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775388124200}}
{"type":"message","id":"c4c67e14","parentId":"36d49430","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:22:10.150Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - there's a voice-call skill that can work with Twilio, Telnyx, Plivo, but it's not integrated with Feishu directly. \n\nCurrently I don't have the ability to make Feishu voice calls directly. However, I can:\n1. Use external voice call providers (Twilio, etc.) if configured\n2. Use TTS (text-to-speech) to send voice messages via Feishu\n\nLet me explain the situation to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"目前我没有**直接拨打飞书语音电话**的能力 😢\n\n**可用的替代方案：**\n\n| 方案 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **TTS 语音消息** | 我可以把文字转为语音，通过消息发送给你 |\n| **外部电话** | 如果配置 Twilio/Telnyx 等 provider，可以直接打手机号（需配置） |\n\n**需要配置才能实现：**\n\n1. 启用 `voice-call` 插件\n2. 配置 Twilio/Telnyx/Plivo 等服务商\n3. 或者用我的 TTS 功能，先把文字变成语音，再发送\n\n---\n\n你想要哪种方案？\n- A) 先试试 TTS 语音消息（文字转语音发送给你）\n- B) 配置外部电话拨打能力（需要服务商账号）\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":495,"output":264,"cacheRead":55549,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56308,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775388124209}}
{"type":"message","id":"e2ac3935","parentId":"c4c67e14","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:22:23.023Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-05 19:22:22 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b5210101358a0b22d17896ebf4f5]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5210101358a0b22d17896ebf4f5\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-04-05 19:22 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\nb"}],"timestamp":1775388143016}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed8d6c64","parentId":"e2ac3935","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:22:32.064Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants option B - to configure external phone calling capability. This requires setting up a voice provider like Twilio, Telnyx, or Plivo.\n\nI need to ask the user which provider they want to use and what credentials they have. Let me explain what's needed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的！要配置外部电话拨打，需要选择服务商并提供 credentials。\n\n**支持的服务商：**\n\n| 服务商 | 需要信息 | 特点 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **Twilio** | Account SID + Auth Token + 来电号码 | 最流行，稳定 |\n| **Telnyx** | API Key + Connection ID + 来电号码 | 音质好 |\n| **Plivo** | Auth ID + Auth Token + 来电号码 | 性价比高 |\n\n---\n\n**你需要提供：**\n1. 选择哪家服务商？\n2. 该服务商的 API credentials（账号、密钥、来电显示号码）\n3. 来电显示号码（需在该平台购买）\n\n配置好后，我就能帮你：\n- 语音电话提醒\n- 自动外呼通知\n- 紧急事件电话报警\n- 会议自动提醒（电话）\n\n---\n\n你有其中哪家服务商的账号吗？或者需要我帮你推荐？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":1295,"output":246,"cacheRead":55101,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56642,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775388143020}}
