{"type":"message","id":"0f8a054e","parentId":"fb05926c","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:23:50.939Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I got some pricing info. Let me summarize this for the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，帮你整理好了三大平台的通话费用对比：\n\n---\n\n## 📞 语音电话费用对比\n\n### 按分钟计费（外呼）\n\n| 平台 | 本地号码外呼 |  Toll-Free 外呼 | 备注 |\n|------|------------|----------------|------|\n| **Twilio** | $0.014/分钟 | $0.014/分钟 | 最知名，文档最全 |\n| **Telnyx** | $0.002/分钟 | $0.002/分钟 | 📌 **最便宜！** |\n| **Plivo** | $0.0115/分钟 | $0.006/分钟 | 中等，有 AI Agent |\n\n### 呼入（接听）\n\n| 平台 | 本地号码 | Toll-Free |\n|------|---------|-----------|\n| **Twilio** | $0.0085/分钟 | $0.014/分钟 |\n| **Telnyx** | $0.002/分钟 | $0.002/分钟 |\n| **Plivo** | $0.0055/分钟 | $0.018/分钟 |\n\n---\n\n## 💰 费用估算场景\n\n假设德隆酒店每天外呼 **50通**，每通 **2分钟**：\n\n| 平台 | 每天 | 每月（30天） | 每年 |\n|------|------|-------------|------|\n| **Telnyx** | $0.20 | $6 | **$72** |\n| **Plivo** | $1.15 | $34.5 | $414 |\n| **Twilio** | $1.40 | $42 | $504 |\n\n---\n\n## 🏆 推荐\n\n| 场景 | 推荐 |\n|------|------|\n| **预算优先** | Telnyx（最便宜） |\n| **文档/生态** | Twilio（最成熟） |\n| **AI Agent** | Plivo（有内置 AI） |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 额外费用\n\n- **来电显示号码**：需单独购买，$1-5/月（取决于号码类型）\n- **短信**：约 $0.007-0.01/条\n- **录音/转录**：额外收费\n\n---\n\nTelnyx 性价比最高！需要我帮你配置吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":1547,"output":488,"cacheRead":61821,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63856,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775388220064}}
