='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream max-header-md:typography-h3-mobile\\\">Products_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream max-header-md:typography-h3-mobile\\\">Solutions_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream max-header-md:typography-h3-mobile\\\">Pricing_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream max-header-md:typography-h3-mobile\\\">Why Telnyx_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream max-header-md:typography-h3-mobile\\\">Resources_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream max-header-md:typography-h3-mobile\\\">Developers[_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream\\\">Contact us](https://telnyx.com/contact-us)[_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream\\\">Log in](https://portal.telnyx.com)[_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream\\\">Contact us](https://telnyx.com/contact-us)[_[data-state='open'])_>_*:not([data-state='open'])_&]:text-gray-inactive header-md:[[data-state='open']_&]:dark:text-cream\\\">Log in](https://portal.telnyx.com)[Sign up](/sign-up)Open menu\\n# Voice API pricing\\nGet flexible and transparent pricing for Voice API, with the option to pay as you go or volume-based pricing.PRICING OPTIONSVolume-based pricingGet set up on a contract, and receive discounted pricing the more calls you make and receive. [See plan&]:translate-x-xxs ml-x