>&]:ml-[0] [.link-rtl>&]:mr-xxs [.link-rtl:hover>&]:-translate-x-xxs\">](#pay-as-you-go)\n## Pay as you go\nPay only for the minutes you use. The cost varies depending on the direction of the call, the number used, and the destination of the call. You can also implement additional features at an extra cost.ServicesMake outbound calls$0.002 per minute + the span]:typography-paragraph md:[&>span]:typography-paragraph-md\" href=\"/pricing/elastic-sip#pay-as-you-go\">SIP Trunking fee for outbound callsReceive inbound callsLocal number$0.002 per minute + the span]:typography-paragraph md:[&>span]:typography-paragraph-md\" href=\"/pricing/elastic-sip#pay-as-you-go\">SIP Trunking fee for inbound callsToll-free number$0.002 per minute + the span]:typography-paragraph md:[&>span]:typography-paragraph-md\" href=\"/pricing/elastic-sip#pay-as-you-go\">SIP Trunking fee for inbound callsFor a full list of global SIP Trunking prices, download our global SIP Trunking span]:typography-paragraph md:[&>span]:typography-paragraph-md\" href=\"#download-pricing\">price sheet&]:translate-x-xxs ml-xxs [.link-rtl>&]:order-[-1] [.link-rtl>&]:ml-[0] [.link-rtl>&]:mr-xxs [.link-rtl:hover>&]:-translate-x-xxs\">If you're using TeXML, you'll be charged the same $0.002 fee.Optional featuresConversational AIspan]:typography-paragraph md:[&>span]:typography-paragraph-md\" href=\"/pricing/conversational-ai\">View comprehensive pricingCall recording$0.002 per minuteCall recording storage$0 per minuteConference calls$0.002 per participant, per minuteSIP interface$0.002 per minuteCall transfer$0.1 per invocationBrowser/app calling$0.002 per minuteSecure mediaFreeStandard answering machine detection$0.002 per callPremium answering machine detection$0.0065 per callTelnyx \n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"011853246a06775b\">>>"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775388815199}}
{"type":"message","id":"d2218c71","parentId":"35d93f0e","timestamp":"2026-04-05T11:33:44.861Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Based on my knowledge and the research, let me provide a clear answer about calling Chinese mobile phones from these platforms.\n\nThe issue is that Twilio, Telnyx, and Plivo are primarily US-based VoIP providers. While they support international calling, there are some important caveats for calling China:\n\n1. **Twilio/Telnyx/Plivo to China mobile phones**: Generally supported but rates vary\n2. **China regulations**: These international VoIP services typically cannot terminate calls directly to Chinese phone numbers without going through approved gateways\n3. **Alternative**: For China-specific calling, you might need a provider with better China coverage or use a different approach\n\nLet me provide a practical answer to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"这是个关键问题！让我直接回答：\n\n---\n\n## 📱 打国内电话的情况\n\n### ⚠️ 实际情况\n\n| 平台 | 打中国 | 说明 |\n|------|-------|------|\n| **Twilio** | ✅ 可以 | 费率较高，需确认线路 |\n| **Telnyx** | ✅ 可以 | 需查具体费率 |\n| **Plivo** | ✅ 可以 | 需查具体费率 |\n\n### 🔥 更适合国内的方案\n\n如果主要打**国内电话**，这几个国际平台可能有以下问题：\n1. **线路绕行** - 国际线路质量不稳定\n2. **政策风险** - 中国对 VoIP 有监管\n3. **费率不透明** - 打国内各省费率不同\n\n---\n\n## 💡 推荐方案\n\n| 方案 | 优点 | 缺点 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **阿里云语音通知** | 国内直连、稳定、合规 | 需要阿里云账号 |\n| **腾讯云呼叫中心** | 微信/QQ打通 | 生态锁定 |\n| **容联云通讯** | 国内厂商、合规 | 文档全英文 |\n\n---\n\n## 🤔 你想怎么用？\n\nA) **打给酒店员工/客人**（国内手机号）→ 推荐用国内厂商\nB) **打给国外客户** → Twilio/Telnyx 就可以\n\n你主要是打给谁？我帮你找最合适的方案 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":3994,"output":438,"cacheRead":63613,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68045,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775388815207}}
